at.box.thinking_level.balanced.label":"Equilibrado","Balanced speed and depth of answers. --- ai_companion.components.chat.box.thinking_level.balanced.description":"Equilibra la velocidad y la profundidad de las respuestas.","Best for quick and simpler answers. --- ai_companion.components.chat.box.thinking_level.fast.description":"Ideal para respuestas rápidas y sencillas.","Boost Pin --- Creator content boost pin action label":"Impulsar Pin","Boost Pin --- Creator profile boost pin action label":"Impulsar Pin","Boost selected Pins --- Creator content bulk boost button label":"Impulsar los Pines seleccionados","Boost selected Pins --- Creator profile bulk boost button label":"Impulsar los Pines seleccionados","Click to upload or drag a media file here. You can also drag media directly from Pinterest.com or pinimg.com. --- developers.tools.aiImageCheck.genaiMessage":"Haz clic para cargar un archivo de medios o arrástralo hasta aquí. También puedes arrastrar medios directamente desde Pinterest.com o pinimg.com.","Couldn’t load requested Pins. --- Creator content requested-tab load error":"No se pudieron cargar los Pines solicitados.","Couldn’t load requested Pins. --- Creator profile requested-tab load error":"No se pudieron cargar los Pines solicitados.","Couldn’t send your request --- Creator content request error modal heading":"No se pudo enviar la solicitud","Couldn’t send your request --- Creator profile request error modal heading":"No se pudo enviar la solicitud","Couldn’t send your request. Try again. --- Creator content single-pin request error message":"No se pudo enviar la solicitud. Vuelve a intentarlo.","Couldn’t send your request. Try again. --- Creator profile single-pin request error message":"No se pudo enviar la solicitud. Vuelve a intentarlo.","Couldn’t send your requests. Try again. --- Creator content bulk request error message":"No se pudieron enviar las solicitudes. Vuelve a intentarlo.","Couldn’t send your requests. Try again. --- Creator prof